[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0509","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1009","title":"Summit Computer Networks Lil' HTTP Server 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Summit Computer Networks Lil' HTTP Server 2.1/2.2 中的 PowerBASIC pbcgi.cgi 脚本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 \"Name\" 或 \"E-mail\" 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本代码，当其他用户访问受影响的页面时，注入的脚本将在其浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击无需认证，利用方式简单，影响 Lil' HTTP Server 2.1 及 2.2 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1009"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:33Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Lil' HTTP Server 至最新版本（如已停止维护，应替换为其他受支持的 Web 服务器，如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）。若无法立即替换，可在 pbcgi.cgi 中对 \"Name\" 和 \"E-mail\" 参数进行 HTML 实体编码过滤，禁止传入 `<script>` 等 HTML 标签字符，同时在 Web 服务器层面配置输出编码（如 Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8）以缓解 XSS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0112.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9548.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5211","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21611","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1009.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1009.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1009","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1009.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1009.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2002/CVE-2002-1009.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1009.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1009.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1009.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1009.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0508","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1008","title":"Summit Computer Networks Lil' HTTP Server 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Summit Computer Networks Lil' HTTP Server 2.2 中集成的 PowerBASIC urlcount.cgi 脚本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 urlcount.cgi 发送包含恶意脚本的特制请求，当服务器 REPORT 功能输出原始请求内容时，由于未对用户输入进行有效过滤，导致恶意脚本在浏览器中执行。攻击者可借此窃取用户会话 Cookie、钓鱼或执行其他恶意操作，影响 Lil' HTTP Server 2.2 及更早版本。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1008"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:33Z","remediation":"立即停止使用已停止维护的 Summit Computer Networks Lil' HTTP Server，迁移至活跃维护的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）。临时缓解措施：删除或重命名服务器上的 urlcount.cgi 脚本文件，或在 Web 服务器配置中限制对 urlcount.cgi 的访问权限（如仅允许本地 IP 访问），同时禁用 REPORT 功能以防止 XSS 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0332.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0072.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9445.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5115","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21581","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1008.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1008.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1008","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1008.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1008.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2002/CVE-2002-1008.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1008.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1008.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1008.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-1008.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0507","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0507.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1007","title":"Blackboard Blackboard 5.0 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"BlackBoard 5.0 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 login.pl 的 course_id 参数、ProcessInfo.cgi 的 CTID 参数或 index.cgi 的 Message 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本代码，当其他用户访问特制链接时脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致会话劫持、信息泄露或钓鱼攻击。攻击无需认证，仅需诱使用户点击恶意链接即可触发。该漏洞影响 BlackBoard 5 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1007"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:33Z","remediation":"升级 Blackboard 至 6.0 及以上版本，该版本已修复多个输入参数（course_id、CTID、Message）的跨站脚本漏洞。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（如 IIS/Apache）层面配置输入过滤规则，对 course_id、CTID、Message 等参数进行 HTML 实体编码，禁止 `<script>` 等标签字符传入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0005.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9467.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5137","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21588","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1007.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1007.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1007","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1007.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1007.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1007.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2002/CVE-2002-1007.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1007.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1007.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1007.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0507.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0506","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1006","title":"BBC Education Betsie parserl.pl 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"BBC Education Betsie 1.5.11 及更早版本的 Text to Speech Internet Enhancer（Betsie）中的 parserl.pl 脚本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 parserl.pl 发送特制的恶意请求，注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当其他用户访问受影响的页面时脚本将在其浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击无需身份认证但需诱导用户交互，影响范围较广。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1006"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:33Z","remediation":"升级 BBC Education Betsie 至 1.5.11 以上版本（如官方已不再维护，建议彻底移除 Betsie 软件或禁用 parserl.pl 脚本）。若无法升级，在 parserl.pl 中对用户输入参数进行 HTML 实体编码过滤，对 <script>、<img> 等危险标签做转义处理，同时在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）层面配置 ModSecurity WAF 规则拦截 XSS 攻击载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0002.html","http://www.bbc.co.uk/education/betsie/parser.pl.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9468.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5135","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21587","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1006.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1006","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1006.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1006.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2002/CVE-2002-1006.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1006.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1006.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1006.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1006.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1006.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0506.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0505","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0505.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1004","title":"ArGoSoft Mail Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"ArGoSoft Mail Server Plus/Pro 1.8.1.5及之前版本的webmail功能存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在URL中注入`..`（点点）序列绕过路径限制，读取服务器上任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击无需身份认证，仅需向目标发送特制HTTP请求即可触发，利用难度较低。该漏洞影响ArGoSoft Mail Server Plus与Pro系列产品，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1004"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:32Z","remediation":"ArGoSoft 已停止维护且官网已不可访问，建议立即迁移至仍在安全更新的邮件服务器（如 hMailServer、MailEnable 等）。如暂时无法迁移，可在 Web 服务器（IIS 或反向代理）层面配置 URL 过滤规则，拦截包含 `..` 或 `_tempatt/../` 的请求路径，同时限制 webmail 功能仅允许内网 IP 访问以降低暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0029.html","http://www.argosoft.com/applications/mailserver/changelist.asp","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9477.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5144","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21591","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1004.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1004.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1004","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1004.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1004.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/abb3d9c240bc75ee9d5885882897d780d10d15cb/2002/CVE-2002-1004.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1004.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1004.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1004.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1004.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0505.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0504","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0504.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1001","title":"AnalogX Proxy 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AnalogX Proxy 4.0 及之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 TCP 6588 端口发送超长 HTTP 请求，或向 TCP 1080 端口发送包含超长 DNS 主机名的 SOCKS 4A 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 AnalogX Proxy 4.12 之前的所有版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1001"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:32Z","remediation":"立即升级 AnalogX Proxy 至 4.12 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Socks4A 和 HTTP 请求的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，在防火墙规则中限制对 TCP 端口 6588 和 1080 的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并禁用 SOCKS 代理功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0006.html","http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/proxy.htm","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9455.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9456.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5138","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5139","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21589","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2002/CVE-2002-1001.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1001.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1001","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1001.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1001.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-20