":"AVE-2002-0495","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0495.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0968","title":"AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 1.16 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标 Web 服务器发送超长的 HTTP 请求方法名（method name）触发该漏洞，导致服务崩溃（拒绝服务）或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 全系列早期版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布更新版本修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 1.17 或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0968"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:28Z","remediation":"立即升级到 AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 1.23 或更高版本（最新版为 1.24），该版本已修复大字符串命令导致的缓冲区溢出问题。从官网 http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/sswww.htm 下载更新。如无法升级，可在防火墙或网络边界限制对服务端口（默认 80）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，以降低远程利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0106.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102563702928443&w=2","http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/sswww.htm","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9338.php","http://www.osvdb.org/3780","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5006","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21542","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2002/CVE-2002-0968.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0968.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0968.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0968.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0968.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0968","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0968.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1