115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0964.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0964","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0964.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0964.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0964.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2002/CVE-2002-0964.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0964.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-09xx/CVE-2002-0964.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0964.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0964.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0493.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0492","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0492.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0962","title":"Geeklog 1.3.5 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Geeklog 1.3.5 及更早版本存在多处跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过以下三个入口注入恶意脚本：日历事件链接字段中的 url 变量、index.php 中的 topic 参数、comment.php 中的 title 参数。当管理员或其他用户访问被注入恶意脚本的页面时，脚本将在浏览器中执行，可能导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或钓鱼攻击。攻击者只需构造特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0962"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:28Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Geeklog 至 1.3.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 calendar event 的 url 参数、index.php 的 topic 参数及 comment.php 的 title 参数的 XSS 过滤缺陷。如无法升级，需在应用层对所有用户输入进行 HTML 实体编码（如将 `<` `>` `\"` `&` 转义）