Voxel Dot Net CBMS 0.7 及更早版本存在多个代码注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 dltclnt.php 等页面发送特制的 SQL 注入请求，以其他用户身份执行未授权操作，包括删除客户端数据等。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可利用，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前官方已不再维护该软件，建议用户迁移至其他替代方案。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0961"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:27Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，无官方补丁可用。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的客户管理系统。如无法立即迁移，采取以下缓解措施：1）在 Web 服务器层（如 .htaccess 或 Nginx 配置）限制对 dltclnt.php、edit.php 等关键脚本的访问，仅允许可信 IP；2）部署 WAF 规则拦截 SQL 注入和 XSS 攻击载荷；3）对 PHP 配置启用 magic_quotes_gpc=On 并关闭 register_globals；4）对用户输入参数（如 idnum）实施严格的整型校验和参数化查询。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0043.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9295.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4957","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21517","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0961.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0961.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0961","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0961.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0961.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-09xx/CVE-2002-0961.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2002/CVE-2002-0961.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0961.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0961.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0961.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0491.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0491.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0490","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0490.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0959","title":"Splatt Forum 3.0 IMG标签HTML注入跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Splatt Forum 3.0 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可在论坛帖子中构造特制的 [img] 图片标签，通过在标签属性中插入闭合引号及恶意脚本代码，当其他用户浏览该帖子时脚本自动执行，导致攻击者能够窃取用户会话 Cookie、伪造页面内容或执行其他恶意操作。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，影响 Splatt Forum 3.0 所有版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0959"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:27Z","remediation":"Splatt Forum 已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即升级到 Splatt Forum 3.0.1 或更高版本（如存在）；若无法升级，修改 forum 源码中处理 [img] 标签的代码，对 src 属性值进行 HTML 实体编码（htmlentities）并过滤双引号及 onerror/onload 等事件处理器。长期方案：迁移至仍受支持的论坛软件（如 phpBB、Simple Machines Forum）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0091.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/275744","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9279.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4953","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21514","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0959.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0959.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0959","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0959.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0959.json","https://github.com